<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Denial</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sevendust</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Home</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">25LbeGnYJuqbkxqc8VyhTs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.050" end="00:28.850">You never say what you mean, all I hear is scream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.850" end="00:34.300">Never say that to me, never say that to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.300" end="00:40.060">Wipe that shit off your face, let's don't stop 'til we bleed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.060" end="00:46.000">The more you spit out your mouth the less I believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.000" end="00:51.790">Denial seems it had to come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.790" end="00:57.660">Relied on me to say it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.660" end="01:04.910">Denial has left you all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.910" end="01:08.290" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.290" end="01:13.870">How can all that shit that you said, ever make any sense?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.870" end="01:19.320">Where did you run to bitch while I was holding my breath?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.320" end="01:25.220">What's sacred? What faded into nothing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.220" end="01:32.170">And never put that on me, never put that on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.170" end="01:37.160">Don't put all on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.160" end="01:42.640">Denial seems it had to come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.640" end="01:48.360">Relied on me to say it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.360" end="01:56.360">Denial's left you all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.710" end="02:05.260">Denial seems it had to come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.260" end="02:10.880">Relied on me to say it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.880" end="02:17.610">Denial's left you all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.610" end="02:25.610" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.660" end="02:50.550" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't put all on me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.550" end="02:57.630" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.630" end="03:01.040" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.040" end="03:07.400" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No, not me, not me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.400" end="03:13.180">Denial seems it had to come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.180" end="03:18.740">Relied on me to say it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.740" end="03:26.740">Denial's left you all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.990" end="03:35.530">Denial seems it had to come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.530" end="03:41.280">Relied on me to say it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.280" end="03:47.910">Denial's left you all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:47.910" end="03:51.910" /></div></body></tt>